---
import content from '../data/chem-content.html?raw';
import '../styles/chem.css';
import {flashcards,questions} from '../../public/chem/retrieval-data.js';
import workflowShell from '../data/chem-workflow-shell.html?raw';
const [guideStart,guideEnd] = content.split('<section id="practice">');
const topics = [...new Set(flashcards.map(card=>card.topic))];
const sections = [
  ['method', '01', 'Show the work'], ['particles', '02', 'Count the right thing'],
  ['conversions', '03', 'Conversion workbench'], ['gases', '04', 'Gas reasoning'],
  ['isotopes', '05', 'Isotopes & averages'], ['mass-spec', '06', 'The spectrometer'],
  ['spectrum', '07', 'Read a spectrum'], ['formulas', '08', 'Determine a formula'],
  ['connections', '09', 'Supporting concepts'], ['practice', '10', 'Practice check'],
  ['answers', '11', 'Worked answer key'], ['activity-check', '12', 'Activity cross-check'],
  ['ready', '13', 'Readiness check'], ['sources', '14', 'Sources & limits'],
];
sections.splice(9,0,['flashcards','09a','Flashcards'],['quick-quiz','09b','Q&A quiz']);
sections.splice(9,0,['random-practice','09c','Randomized practice']);
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive,noimageindex" />
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer" />
    <meta name="description" content="CHEM 004 Learning Check 2 study desk: complete conversion chains, mass spectrometry, isotopes, gas reasoning, formulas, and original practice with worked answers." />
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://boomerrawlings.com/chem/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>CHEM · Learning Check 2 Study Desk</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to study guide</a>
    <header class="masthead"><a class="brand" href="#start"><span class="brand-icon">C<span>04</span></span><span>CHEM <b>Study desk</b></span></a><div><button id="workflow-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="chem-workflow-panel">Show workflow</button><span class="exam-label">THU 10.22.26</span><a href="/">Boomer Rawlings ↗</a></div></header>
    <section id="chem-workflow-panel" aria-label="Chemistry problem workflows" hidden><div id="chem-workflow-host"></div></section>
    <template id="chem-workflow-template"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/chem/workflow.css?v=20261017" /><Fragment set:html={workflowShell} /></template>
    <div class="page-layout">
      <aside><nav aria-label="Study guide sections"><p class="eyebrow">The study route</p>{sections.map(([id, number, title]) => <a href={`#${id}`}><span>{number}</span>{title}</a>)}</nav><p class="rail-note">Understand the chain.<br>Run it backward.<br>Explain why it works.</p></aside>
      <main id="main">
        <Fragment set:html={guideStart} />
        <section id="random-practice">
          <div class="section-head"><span>09c / Fresh problems</span><h2>New numbers. Same reasoning.</h2></div>
          <p class="lede">Generate a mixed set across the supplied lectures and notes: conversions in both directions, all seven diatomic elements, gases, isotopes, fragmentation, spectra, formulas, matter, phases, and energy.</p>
          <button type="button" id="random-new">New randomized practice ↻</button>
          <p id="random-status" role="status"></p>
          <p class="small">Original hypothetical practice, not predicted exam questions. Work on paper, showing units; reveal each worked answer afterward. The button replaces this set and hides its answers. Answers use unrounded intermediate values, displayed to about four significant figures. Includes supporting earlier material; unavailable October 20 lecture and Activities 7–8 remain outside coverage.</p>
          <noscript>Enable JavaScript to generate fresh practice; the fixed practice and worked answer key below remain available.</noscript>
          <div id="random-problems"></div>
        </section>
        <section id="flashcards">
          <div class="section-head"><span>09a / Active recall</span><h2>Say it before you reveal it.</h2></div>
          <p class="lede">{flashcards.length} flashcards: methods, distinctions, and reasoning traps—not just definitions. Answer aloud or on paper, then reveal the explanation.</p>
          <div class="controls"><label>Flashcard topic<select id="flash-topic"><option value="all">All topics</option>{topics.map(topic=><option value={topic}>{topic}</option>)}</select></label><button type="button" id="flash-shuffle">Shuffle cards</button></div>
          <div class="flashcard" aria-label="Flashcard study area">
            <div class="flash-meta"><p class="eyebrow" id="flash-category">{flashcards[0].topic}</p><p id="flash-progress" aria-live="polite">Card 1 of {flashcards.length}</p></div>
            <h3 id="flash-prompt">{flashcards[0].prompt}</h3>
            <button type="button" id="flash-flip" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flash-answer">Show answer</button>
            <div id="flash-answer" hidden><p id="flash-response">{flashcards[0].answer}</p><a id="flash-source" href={`#${flashcards[0].source}`}>Review the explanation ↑</a></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flash-navigation"><button type="button" id="flash-prev">← Previous card</button><button type="button" id="flash-next">Next card →</button></div>
          <p class="small">Changing cards hides the answer again. Topic filters and shuffle stay on this page. Progress is for this visit.</p>
          <details class="card-bank"><summary>Browse all {flashcards.length} flashcards / print list</summary><dl>{flashcards.map(card=><div><dt>{card.prompt}</dt><dd>{card.answer} <a href={`#${card.source}`}>Review topic ↑</a></dd></div>)}</dl></details>
        </section>
        <section id="quick-quiz">
          <div class="section-head"><span>09b / Q&A practice</span><h2>Choose, check, understand why.</h2></div>
          <p class="lede">{questions.length} original questions with immediate feedback and explained answers. Work out each answer before choosing. Everything stays on this page.</p>
          <div class="controls"><label>Q&A topic<select id="qa-topic"><option value="all">All topics</option>{topics.map(topic=><option value={topic}>{topic}</option>)}</select></label><button type="button" id="qa-reset">Reset quiz answers</button></div>
          <p id="qa-score" class="quiz-score" role="status">Current answers: 0 correct / 0 checked. {questions.length} questions available.</p>
          <p class="small">The score reflects your latest checked choices, including corrections. It is self-study feedback, not a graded exam. Option order is shuffled for each visit.</p>
          <noscript><p>Select an answer on paper, then open “Answer & explanation.” Automatic checks require JavaScript.</p></noscript>
          {questions.map((question,index)=><article class="qa-item" id={`qa-${question.id}`} data-qa={question.id} data-topic={question.topic}>
            <p class="eyebrow">Q{index+1} · {question.topic}</p>
            <fieldset><legend>{question.prompt}</legend><div class="qa-options">{question.options.map((option,i)=><label><input type="radio" name={`qa-${question.id}`} value={i} /><span>{option}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
            <button type="button" class="qa-check" data-check={question.id}>Check answer</button>
            <p class="qa-feedback" id={`feedback-${question.id}`} aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
            <details class="qa-solution"><summary>Answer & explanation</summary><p><strong>Answer:</strong> {question.options[question.correct]}</p><p>{question.explanation} <a href={`#${question.source}`}>Review topic ↑</a></p></details>
          </article>)}
        </section>
        <Fragment set:html={'<section id="practice">'+guideEnd} />
      </main>
    </div>
    <footer><a href="#start">Back to top ↑</a><p>CHEM 004 · October 22, 2026 · Independent study notes</p><a href="/">boomerrawlings.com</a></footer>
    <script src="/chem/study.js" type="module" is:inline></script>
    <script src="/chem/retrieval.js" type="module" is:inline></script>
    <script src="/chem/random-practice.js?v=20261017-workflow" type="module" is:inline></script>
    <script src="/chem/workflow.js?v=20261017" type="module" is:inline></script>
  </body>
</html>
